{"4704260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aptacris : Dipolos Anomalia", "steam_appid": 4704260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/a880e6b1df9afd0f9bd1288a7e04a67b.avif?t=1786038183\" width=1024 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/0613d0929bd41e892fae4a553f6036d1.poster.avif?t=1786038183\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/0613d0929bd41e892fae4a553f6036d1.webm?t=1786038183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/0613d0929bd41e892fae4a553f6036d1.mp4?t=1786038183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate memory worlds by switching between two perception modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objects, structures, and dangers exist differently depending on the active mode:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal hidden paths and bridges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate structures inaccessible in another state</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bypass obstacles by changing perception</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid deadly anomalies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles built around shifting realities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every memory can be experienced in more than one way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/b4654590fbd38096fb66de61274a46a8.avif?t=1786038183\" width=1024 height=75 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/d8683e9ab9800235b100703fce83ac0f.avif?t=1786038183\" width=1024 height=75 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/ab482a62dc5a7982001e0e4f6cc366b5.poster.avif?t=1786038183\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/ab482a62dc5a7982001e0e4f6cc366b5.webm?t=1786038183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/ab482a62dc5a7982001e0e4f6cc366b5.mp4?t=1786038183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through memories shaped by the experiences of different characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each memory reflects emotions, events, and distorted perceptions of the past, creating unique puzzle environments to explore and solve</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/b4654590fbd38096fb66de61274a46a8.avif?t=1786038183\" width=1024 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/6d7b2538f1a887e23a33a3220ca682bd.avif?t=1786038183\" width=1024 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/5d64d28ec5709a8bfa74fdd458118d70.poster.avif?t=1786038183\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/5d64d28ec5709a8bfa74fdd458118d70.webm?t=1786038183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/5d64d28ec5709a8bfa74fdd458118d70.mp4?t=1786038183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to a central Hub between your dive on memories, where story events unfold and new paths become available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden connections between characters and uncover the truth behind Ai'Lynn's mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/b4654590fbd38096fb66de61274a46a8.avif?t=1786038183\" width=1024 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/512a6a57b85d52d456072ba7bf6d32d7.avif?t=1786038183\" width=1024 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/6b25ef6b961cefae4e33b3b71edce5b2.poster.avif?t=1786038183\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/6b25ef6b961cefae4e33b3b71edce5b2.webm?t=1786038183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/6b25ef6b961cefae4e33b3b71edce5b2.mp4?t=1786038183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature and technology have merged into a single ecosystem powered by A.P.T.A., a mysterious energy linked to all living beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every individual possesses a unique form of A.P.T.A., granting extraordinary abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ai'Lynn's power allows her to enter and alter memories, turning the human mind into both a puzzle and a battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/b4654590fbd38096fb66de61274a46a8.avif?t=1786038183\" width=1024 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/9ee7c827a6d835e31f867e6440b7eec8.avif?t=1786038183\" width=1024 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/5b1d37232d3d72ffa9af914692635abc.poster.avif?t=1786038183\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/5b1d37232d3d72ffa9af914692635abc.webm?t=1786038183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/5b1d37232d3d72ffa9af914692635abc.mp4?t=1786038183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ai'Lynn has one radical objective:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clone herself to eradicate the &quot;A.P.T.A.&quot; that resides within humanity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To achieve this, she uses her unique ability to enter and rewrite memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ironically, this same ability once allowed her to reclaim the energy she had left within her sister, leaving part of her own memories fractured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of her ally, Lepheus, she dives into her own fragmented memories in search of the missing piece needed to complete her plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As she journeys through the memories of others and revisits her own past, she begins to uncover truths that challenge everything she believes about herself, the A.P.T.A., and the world she is trying to save.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/b4654590fbd38096fb66de61274a46a8.avif?t=1786038183\" width=1024 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/a880e6b1df9afd0f9bd1288a7e04a67b.avif?t=1786038183\" width=1024 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/0613d0929bd41e892fae4a553f6036d1.poster.avif?t=1786038183\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/0613d0929bd41e892fae4a553f6036d1.webm?t=1786038183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/0613d0929bd41e892fae4a553f6036d1.mp4?t=1786038183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate memory worlds by switching between two perception modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objects, structures, and dangers exist differently depending on the active mode:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal hidden paths and bridges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate structures inaccessible in another state</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bypass obstacles by changing perception</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid deadly anomalies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles built around shifting realities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every memory can be experienced in more than one way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/b4654590fbd38096fb66de61274a46a8.avif?t=1786038183\" width=1024 height=75 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/d8683e9ab9800235b100703fce83ac0f.avif?t=1786038183\" width=1024 height=75 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/ab482a62dc5a7982001e0e4f6cc366b5.poster.avif?t=1786038183\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/ab482a62dc5a7982001e0e4f6cc366b5.webm?t=1786038183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/ab482a62dc5a7982001e0e4f6cc366b5.mp4?t=1786038183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through memories shaped by the experiences of different characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each memory reflects emotions, events, and distorted perceptions of the past, creating unique puzzle environments to explore and solve</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/b4654590fbd38096fb66de61274a46a8.avif?t=1786038183\" width=1024 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/6d7b2538f1a887e23a33a3220ca682bd.avif?t=1786038183\" width=1024 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/5d64d28ec5709a8bfa74fdd458118d70.poster.avif?t=1786038183\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/5d64d28ec5709a8bfa74fdd458118d70.webm?t=1786038183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/5d64d28ec5709a8bfa74fdd458118d70.mp4?t=1786038183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to a central Hub between your dive on memories, where story events unfold and new paths become available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden connections between characters and uncover the truth behind Ai'Lynn's mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/b4654590fbd38096fb66de61274a46a8.avif?t=1786038183\" width=1024 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4704260/extras/512a6a57b85d52d456072ba7bf6d32d7.avif?t=1786038183\" width=1024 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s